── HTTP endpoint hardening (localhost Host/Origin validation) ────────────────

▶ Wrong path
  POST /other({})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    {
      "status": 404,
      "body": "MCP endpoint is /mcp"
    }

▶ Foreign Host header (DNS-rebinding attempt)
  POST /mcp({"Host":"evil.example"})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    {
      "status": 403,
      "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"error\":{\"code\":-32000,\"message\":\"Invalid Host: evil.example\"},\"id\":null}"
    }

▶ Foreign Origin header (browser page on another site)
  POST /mcp({"Origin":"https://evil.example"})
  ✔ 0ms → 
    {
      "status": 403,
      "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"error\":{\"code\":-32000,\"message\":\"Invalid Origin: evil.example\"},\"id\":null}"
    }

